              <p>Before you call a contractor, get crystal clear on your vision. Ask yourself:</p>
              <ul class="post-list">
                <li>Is my kitchen storage cabinet situation driving me crazy?</li>
                <li>Do I need more functional mudroom cabinetry or mudroom storage cabinets to keep the entryway organized?</li>
                <li>Am I dreaming about custom kitchen cabinetry or even premium kitchen cabinets?</li>
                <li>Would a second-story addition give us the extra space we need?</li>
              </ul>
              <p>Also decide the scope. Are you doing a simple refresh—like decorative wall trim or hiring crown molding installers—or a complete home addition?</p>
              <p><em>Pro Tip:</em> Save photos, Pinterest boards, or magazine clippings. Visual references help contractors understand your style.</p>
            </div>

