              <p>Not all contractors are the same. In Pennsylvania, you might need:</p>
              <ul class="post-list">
                <li><strong>General Contractors:</strong> For large remodels involving multiple trades.</li>
                <li><strong>Specialized Contractors:</strong> If you're only updating a bathroom, adding office cabinets, or finishing a basement.</li>
                <li><strong>Custom Carpentry Experts:</strong> For unique work like built-ins, trim carpentry, or luxury kitchen cabinets.</li>
                <li><strong>Design-Build Firms:</strong> One-stop shops that handle both design and construction.</li>
              </ul>
              <p>Local expertise matters. The best remodeling contractor in Pennsylvania knows regional building codes, climate considerations, and home styles.</p>
            </div>

