                <li>Search Google using your town name: "renovation services near me" or "custom carpentry Paoli."</li>
                <li>Check review sites like Google, Yelp, and Angi. Verify any candidate's HIC registration with the <a href="https://www.attorneygeneral.gov/protect-yourself/home-improvement-contractor/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Pennsylvania Attorney General's HIC contractor lookup</a>.</li>
                <li>Look in local Facebook groups and community boards.</li>
                <li>Visit home expos and showrooms to see residential construction services in action.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

